OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 130 children at heart of
OL,4,Acourt hearings as religious group abuse
OL,5,Aprobe continues
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 134 children are involved in
OL,8,F"unprecedented" family court
OL,9,Fproceedings related to a religious
OL,10,Fcommunity which is at the centre of
OL,11,Fsexual abuse and human trafficking
OL,12,Fallegations, the Court of Appeal has
OL,13,Fheard.
OL,15,FFamily courts are dealing with more
OL,16,Fthan 60 cases linked to children who
OL,17,Fhave connections to the Ahmadi Religion
OL,18,Fof Peace and Light (AROPL).
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
