OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 130 children at heart of
OL,4,Acourt hearings as religious group abuse
OL,5,Aprobe continues
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe group's base, Webb House in Crewe,
OL,8,FCheshire, was raided in April by police
OL,9,Finvestigating suspected underage
OL,10,Fmarriage and modern slavery offences.
OL,12,FIn May, a judge allowed some children
OL,13,Flinked to the site to be placed into
OL,14,Fcare, prompting parental challenges to
OL,15,Fthat ruling at the Court of Appeal,
OL,16,Fwhere on Thursday the number of
OL,17,Fchildren whose welfare is the subject
OL,18,Fof family court proceedings emerged.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
